{"task_id": "Mbpp/252", "solution": "from math import sqrt, atan2\n\nclass ComplexNumber:\n    \"\"\"Encapsulates real and imaginary parts of a complex number.\"\"\"\n    def __init__(self, real: float, imag: float) -> None:\n        self.real = real\n        self.imag = imag\n\n    @staticmethod\n    def from_builtin(value) -> 'ComplexNumber':\n        \"\"\"Creates a ComplexNumber from a built-in numeric type.\"\"\"\n        if isinstance(value, complex):\n            return ComplexNumber(value.real, value.imag)\n        else:\n            return ComplexNumber(float(value), 0.0)\n\ndef convert(value) -> (float, float):\n    \"\"\"\n    Converts a complex or real number to polar coordinates (r, theta).\n    r = sqrt(real^2 + imag^2), theta = atan2(imag, real).\n    \"\"\"\n    complex_num = ComplexNumber.from_builtin(value)\n    real_part = complex_num.real\n    imag_part = complex_num.imag\n\n    r = sqrt(real_part**2 + imag_part**2)\n    theta = atan2(imag_part, real_part)\n\n    return (r, theta)"}
